BLACK VEIL is an original cybersecurity research framework
developed by Shree Kamesh Kumar.

This project introduces a cognitive cyber defense architecture
integrating

• Autonomous Cognitive Defense Orchestrator (ACDO)

• Trust Threat Reputation Model (TTRM)

• Dynamic Credential Mutation Model (DCMM)

• Reality Fabric

• Living Attack Memory Graph (LAMG)

• Adaptive Security Actions Layer

